SUBJ/TROPICAL CYCLONE FORMATION ALERT CORRECTED //
WTPN22 PHNC 052100 COR
REF/A/JOINT TYPHOON WRNCEN PEARL HARBOR HI/052100Z NOV 26//
AMPN/REF IS TROPICAL CYCLONE FORMATION ALERT (WTPN22 PHNC 052100)//
RMKS/
1. FORMATION OF A SIGNIFICANT TROPICAL CYCLONE IS POSSIBLE WITHIN
140 NM EITHER SIDE OF A LINE FROM 10.5N 145.6W TO 11.4N 156.7W
WITHIN THE NEXT 12 TO 24 HOURS. AVAILABLE DATA DOES NOT JUSTIFY
ISSUANCE OF NUMBERED TROPICAL CYCLONE WARNINGS AT THIS TIME.
WINDS IN THE AREA ARE ESTIMATED TO BE 27 TO 32 KNOTS. METSAT
IMAGERY AT 052100Z INDICATES THAT A CIRCULATION CENTER IS LOCATED
NEAR 10.5N 145.6W. THE SYSTEM IS MOVING WESTWARD AT 12 KNOTS.
2. REMARKS:
MAXIMUM SUSTAINED SURFACE WINDS ARE ESTIMATED AT 27 TO 32 KNOTS.
MINIMUM SEA LEVEL PRESSURE IS ESTIMATED TO BE NEAR 999 MB. THE
POTENTIAL FOR THE DEVELOPMENT OF A SIGNIFICANT TROPICAL CYCLONE
WITHIN THE NEXT 24 HOURS IS HIGH. THIS SUPERSEDES REF A.
3. THIS ALERT WILL BE REISSUED, UPGRADED TO WARNING OR CANCELLED BY 062100Z.
